{"unit_id":"tag:03S0:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>分离（separated），则这是《态射（Morphisms）续论》引理<REF_0001>。一般情形下，可假设<MATH_0002>仿射（affine）。选取有限（finite）的仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>。将前一情形应用于所有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>及<MATH_0005>，并选取所得分划（partitions）的共同细化（refinement）<MATH_0006>。进一步细化分划后，可假设<MATH_0007>也仿射（affine）。固定<MATH_0008>，置<MATH_0009>。态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>及<MATH_0011>有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）。因此<MATH_0012>及<MATH_0013>为仿射概形（affine schemes），且<MATH_0014>既闭又开（因为<MATH_0015>固有（proper），故态射（Morphisms）引理<REF_0002>适用）。于是<MATH_0016>分离（separated），因为<MATH_0017>满射（surjective），见概形（Schemes）引理<REF_0003>。因此，前一情形适用于<MATH_0018>，且若有必要，可进一步细化分划（实际上并无必要，但这里不需要此事实）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"partitions","target_term":"分划"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"sou