{"unit_id":"tag:095K:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine schemes）的拟有限（quasi-finite）且有限表现（finitely presented）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 存在仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>及闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0003>，使\n<STRUCT_0003>\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0004>为加厚（thickening），且\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0005>为有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007> 存在有限（finite）分划（partition）<MATH_0006>，由局部闭（locally closed）、可构造（constructible）、仿射（affine）的层（strata）组成，以及满射（surjective）有限局部自由（finite locally free）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>，使<MATH_0008>的约化（reduction）同构于（isomorphic）<MATH_0009>，对某个<MATH_0010>如此。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-finite","target_term":"拟有限"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"分划"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"strata","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"finite locally free","target_term":"有限局部自由"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduction","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构于"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-finite","target_term":"拟有限